cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use FlyGI, cite this software and the MaleCNS dataset and paper
  identified in the repository's data provenance documentation.
title: FlyGI
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - name: FlyGI contributors
abstract: >-
  FlyGI is an experimental framework for testing whether the topology of the
  MaleCNS v1.0 fruit-fly connectome offers measurable advantages on interactive
  ARC-AGI-3 tasks relative to matched graph controls.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - ARC-AGI-3
  - connectome
  - Drosophila
  - reservoir computing
  - reproducible research
